CVPR 2027 Paper (typage/cvpr) - license

This template contains files from two sources.

  main.tex, refs.bib, manifest.json, typage.json, LICENSE
      Written by 7D24H. CC0-1.0: dedicated to the public domain; papers
      written from this template need no attribution.
      https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode

  cvpr.sty, ieeenat_fullname.bst
      The official CVPR 2027 author kit, published by the CVPR organizers in
      https://github.com/cvpr-org/author-kit (release CVPR2027-v1, commit
      a2369342011145be8c85e5ad21a9b61f9fa53473).
      The files carry no license statement; rights remain with their
      authors. They are redistributed unmodified, so that the template
      compiles offline. The full kit (rebuttal template, supplementary
      material, formatting instructions) is in the repository above.

The packages the sample loads come from the built-in Tectonic bundle under
their own licenses. Check https://cvpr.thecvf.com for the rules that apply
to your submission.
